-- Maraudon (purple wing), map 349: the whole wing as one plan (dungeons/maraudon_purple.json, status 'draft (not mapped,
-- not live-checked)'), exported from turtle-agent 7f333d0 with the options of the other 20261023 plans:
--   turtle-agent plan-export --mmaps <map 349 mmaps> --allow-draft --gm-cross-direct --approach-hops --rev 7f333d0 \
--     --stamp 20261024010000 --out <dir> maraudon_purple
-- 6 legs (lord_vyletongue, celebras_the_cursed, landslide, tinkerer_gizlock, rotgrip, princess_theradras), 1652 steps
-- (1659 rows): 142 pulls, 1504 moves, 6 bosses. Plan check (map 349 mmaps): 1 of 397 points fails, the rotgrip boss point
-- (needs_walk: its mapping walk is still to do); 91 warnings (80 estimated patrol periods + the 11 detour groups: leg 0
-- groups 2/3/14/24/25/48/49/71, leg 2 groups 20/21, leg 3 group 6) and 136 run-leader hop notices.
-- Census fixes in this export (world export tools/dungeongen/testdata/map349 + tortoise-wow sql/base, no live DB):
--   * critters out of every pull: 2914 Snake, 4076 Roach, 6145 School of Fish, 13321 Frog (faction 188/190, 1 hp, type 8);
--     37 pure critter pulls are gone and 12 mixed groups lost their critter positions.
--   * boss-linked trash out of the pulls: the two Putridus Shadowstalkers (11792, guids 54675/54676) linked to Lord
--     Vyletongue and Celebras' three Corrupt Forces of Nature (13743, guids 55107-55109) linked to him (creature_groups
--     flags 2/15, aggro together): the boss steps bring them. No boss.first field is used (11792 stands in other pulls).
--   * leg 0 group 40 keeps both Cavern Lurkers as one pull; Meshlok the Harvester (12237, rare rank 2) patrols through
--     them and is in every leg's skip list, not a member. Leg 3 group 6 is 10 units on purpose: two linked packs (5 Deep
--     Borers + 5 Theradrim Shardlings) interleaved within 8 yd. Leg 3 groups 16/17 take the rest of their linked groups.
--   * every radius is the group's farthest wander + 2 (5-8 yd): no row reaches a neighbouring pack (the generator's 25 did).
--   * 80 patrol blocks (one per group whose anchors come within 25 yd of a hostile creature_movement path, nearest first);
--     periods are estimates (path length at 2.5 yd/s).
-- Rows cannot carry: entrance/trigger 3134/portal and teleports, level_band [44 49], hire_composition, the six skip lists
-- [12237], fleers [12216], the patrol blocks, needs_walk. Also not in any pull: 56 hostile Vile Larvae 12218 (non-elite) whose
-- linked groups the leg-0 approach path passes within 0.7-6 yd of, the friendly Spirit of Maraudos 12242 (2.3 yd from the
-- leg-0 route), Elder Splitrock 15556 (3.3 yd, leg 4) and Celebras the Redeemed 13716 (0.0 yd on the Celebras boss point);
-- Princess Theradras summons 12238 on aggro (script). No door, lever or key is in the wing.
--
-- Dungeon plans for the run leader (.bot run), exported by turtle-agent (plan-export). Plan format v1; the mapping is
-- docs/guides/dungeon-run-leader.md ("From plan v1 to rows"). The plan file in turtle-agent is the single source: edit it
-- there and export again, never these rows by hand. The plan row carries the unit lists cc_priority, cc_always and kill_first
-- (columns from 20261015200000_world.sql). Never edit this file once applied; export a new one.
--
-- Idempotent: each plan's rows are deleted, then inserted. The tables come from 20261014150000_world.sql.

-- maraudon_purple: map 349, 6 legs, 1652 steps
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_step` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_purple';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_leg` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_purple';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_plan` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_purple';

-- Dungeon bosses of map 349 for this plan's boss steps only (the commander telemetry's boss rank; see 20261021114931_world.sql):
-- the six boss entries, all rank 1 in turtle-wow sql/base creature_template. The DELETE is scoped to these entries, so another
-- plan's rows on map 349 (maraudon_orange) survive.
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_boss` WHERE `map` IN (349) AND `entry` IN (12236,12225,12203,13601,13596,12201);
